{"seq":2,"slug":"sortation-chute-destination-routing","title":"分拣格口分配与目的地路由策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/conveyor-sortation-routing/sortation-chute-destination-routing","wordCount":3535,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"分拣格口分配与目的地路由策略\">分拣格口分配与目的地路由策略</h1><p>分拣机转得再快，如果格口分配策略是错的，整条线照样会&quot;堵在最后一米&quot;。行业里对分拣的标准定义是&quot;在输送系统上识别物品，并将其分流到特定目的地&quot;——识别与分流是两件独立的事，前者的产物（一个目的地代码）才是后者唯一的输入 [来源：Wikipedia, Sortation, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sortation]。本文讲的是中间那层被大多数人忽略的软件：**目的地模型如何构造、格口如何被分配给目的地、路由决策什么时候下发、以及波峰来临时格口怎么再平衡**。设备选型与吞吐公式属于上游问题，见同章的\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sortation]。本文讲的是中间那层被大多数人忽略的软件：**目的地模型如何构造、格口如何被分配给目的地、路由决策什么时候下发、以及波峰来临时格口怎么再平衡**。设备选型与吞吐公式属于上游问题，见同章的</a> <a href=\"conveyor-topology-accumulation-flow\">输送线拓扑、积放与流量控制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把格口（chute / destination）当成包裹的固定终点、维护一张&quot;包裹→格口&quot;静态映射表，是初学者最常见的错误。正确的视角相反：<strong>格口是稀缺资源，目的地是需求，两者之间靠一层分配策略动态撮合</strong>。一台交叉带分拣机的格口数量是硬件约束，而它要服务的收货人、承运商分区、线路单号每天都在变；当目的地数超过格口数时映射必然一对多，多个目的地共享一个格口，靠格口端的二次分拣（人工或小分拣机）再拆开。</p>\n<p>贯穿全文的量先钉死：<strong>格口容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></strong>（单位时间能&quot;消化&quot;多少件，受打包工位、周转箱更换、下游输送限制）；<strong>格口占用时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></strong>（从落格到清走，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = 1/S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>）；<strong>目的地需求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>（某目的地单位时间到达件数，随单量曲线波动）；<strong>分拣键（sort key）</strong>（把订单语义压成的稳定代码，是分配唯一的输入）；<strong>位置窗口</strong>（从下发分流指令到机构动作完成对应的行进距离，决定决策必须提前多久做）。</p>\n<p>把格口看成&quot;容量有限的服务器&quot;，分拣路由立刻退化成排队论问题：格口稳定工作的条件是到达率小于服务率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_d &lt; \\mu_c = C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，否则队列无界增长，表现为格口堆货、包裹弹回主线。一次成功的分拣要串起五个环节——扫描、构造分拣键、分配格口、下发路由、落格，任何一环断裂包裹就落到异常口或进入再循环。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[包裹入线&lt;br/&gt;induct] --&gt; B[扫描&lt;br/&gt;条码/体积/重量]&#10;    B --&gt; C{目的地解析&lt;br/&gt;sort key 构造}&#10;    C --&gt;|命中格口映射| D[分配格口&lt;br/&gt;chute assign]&#10;    C --&gt;|无法解析| E[异常格口&lt;br/&gt;exception lane]&#10;    D --&gt; F{格口容量&lt;br/&gt;是否可用}&#10;    F --&gt;|可用| G[下发路由&lt;br/&gt;divert 指令]&#10;    F --&gt;|已满/溢出| H[再循环&lt;br/&gt;recirculation]&#10;    H --&gt; C&#10;    G --&gt; I[格口滑槽&lt;br/&gt;chute]&#10;    I --&gt; J[二次分拣 / 打包 / 装车]\">graph TD\n    A[包裹入线&lt;br/&gt;induct] --&gt; B[扫描&lt;br/&gt;条码/体积/重量]\n    B --&gt; C{目的地解析&lt;br/&gt;sort key 构造}\n    C --&gt;|命中格口映射| D[分配格口&lt;br/&gt;chute assign]\n    C --&gt;|无法解析| E[异常格口&lt;br/&gt;exception lane]\n    D --&gt; F{格口容量&lt;br/&gt;是否可用}\n    F --&gt;|可用| G[下发路由&lt;br/&gt;divert 指令]\n    F --&gt;|已满/溢出| H[再循环&lt;br/&gt;recirculation]\n    H --&gt; C\n    G --&gt; I[格口滑槽&lt;br/&gt;chute]\n    I --&gt; J[二次分拣 / 打包 / 装车]</pre><h2 id=\"目的地模型-从订单到分拣键\">目的地模型：从订单到分拣键</h2><p>格口分配的第一个输入是<strong>分拣键（sort key / destination code）</strong>——&quot;这件包裹属于哪个目的地&quot;的软件表达。构造错的 sort key 会在下游引发无法回溯的错分，因此它必须在扫描点完成，且必须<strong>稳定可复现</strong>：同一件包裹重扫两次必须得到同一个键。</p>\n<p>sort key 按&quot;先粗后细&quot;分层。<strong>一级键</strong>决定大方向（承运商+服务类型，或干线发运方向）；<strong>二级键</strong>决定细分区（同城分区、省区、承运商批次）；<strong>三级键</strong>才是具体收货人或门店。软件上把三级键拼成定长字符串或用数字段编码，映射粒度由现场格口数决定——格口少时映射到一级键，格口多时到二级或三级。</p>\n<p>上游数据的标准化程度直接决定 sort key 的质量。跨境场景里包裹常带 GS1-128 标签，其中 SSCC（Serial Shipping Container Code，序列货运集装箱代码）提供全局唯一的物流单元标识，而路由信息往往放在应用标识符（AI）段里 [来源：GS1, SSCC 与 GS1-128 应用标识符标准, <a href=\"https://www.gs1.org/standards/id-keys/sscc]。WCS\">https://www.gs1.org/standards/id-keys/sscc]。WCS</a> 不解析业务语义，它只信任上游 WMS/WES 下发的字段——这层责任边界必须在接口契约里写死，否则一旦上游改了字段含义，分拣机会安静地按旧规则错分。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>典型取值</th>\n<th>格口粒度</th>\n<th>谁负责构造</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一级键</td>\n<td>承运商 + 服务类型</td>\n<td>大方向格口（约 5–20 个）</td>\n<td>WMS/WES</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二级键</td>\n<td>发运批次 / 省区 / 分区</td>\n<td>中粒度格口（约 20–200 个）</td>\n<td>WES 或 WCS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三级键</td>\n<td>门店 / 收货人 / 线路单</td>\n<td>细粒度格口（可达数百个）</td>\n<td>WCS + 格口映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常键</td>\n<td>无读、超规、缺件</td>\n<td>专用异常口</td>\n<td>WCS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"格口分配策略-静态-动态与热格口\">格口分配策略：静态、动态与热格口</h2><p>分配策略的核心矛盾是**&quot;稳定&quot;与&quot;均衡&quot;的取舍**。做一张当天固定的目的地→格口映射表（静态分配）最省事，操作员知道货往哪走、下游打包也形成肌肉记忆；但一旦某个目的地爆量，它的格口先满，其余格口却空着，整体吞吐被单个热点拖垮。行业里把这叫<strong>热格口问题（hot chute）</strong>。</p>\n<p>动态分配把映射当成可随时调整的资源分配问题：WCS 持续观测每个目的地的到达率和每个格口的占用率，在格口满之前把热点目的地分流到备用格口。工程上常见几档做法——**溢出格口（overflow chute）**给热点目的地预指一个备份格口，实现最简单但备份平时可能闲置；<strong>格口负载再平衡</strong>周期性求解&quot;目的地→格口&quot;分配，目标最小化最大格口负载、约束每个目的地至少一格且每格容量不超限，本质是带容量的指派问题；<strong>按单量曲线预分配</strong>用历史同期单量预测各目的地占比，开工前按预测比例切好格口，跨境大促（双 11、黑五）常见做法是按预测峰值预留冗余格口。</p>\n<p>跨境场景的特殊约束在于<strong>目的地分布极度不均</strong>：少数国家/线路常占大部分件量，呈现明显的长尾（帕累托/齐夫分布），前几个目的地可能吃掉 50% 以上件量。把格口数按目的地个数平均切是最糟的切法；正确做法是按预期件量加权切分，并对头部目的地预留溢出通道。</p>\n<p>格口需求估算：若整线流量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span></span></span></span></span> 件/h，各目的地件量占比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，格口服务能力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 件/h，则保守格口数</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>≥</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>d</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><mi>C</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\geq \\sum_{d} \\left\\lceil \\frac{\\Lambda \\cdot p_d}{C} \\right\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个和式是<strong>上界</strong>：它给每个目的地都至少分一个独立格口，因此必然不小于&quot;总流量除以单格口能力&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Lambda / C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>——差额来自每个求和项向上取整的损失。实际格口数应取在下界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Lambda / C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 与该上界之间，通过让低件量目的地共用格口来逼近下界；共用的代价是格口端需要二次分拣。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路由决策的下发时机与位置窗口\">路由决策的下发时机与位置窗口</h2><p>格口一旦定下，就要解决&quot;什么时候告诉分拣机往哪个格口扔&quot;。分流机构（shoe、摆轮、翻盘、皮带横移）的机械动作需要时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{act}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而包裹在移动，因此指令必须<strong>提前一个位置窗口</strong>下发。若线速为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，动作时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{act}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则提前量</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = v \\cdot t_{act}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如线速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.5</mn><mtext> m/s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = 2.5\\ \\text{m/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m/s</span></span></span></span></span></span>、动作时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mtext> s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{act} = 0.4\\ \\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span>，提前量就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\ \\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>。交叉带分拣机的典型线速可达 2.5 m/s（部分设计到 3 m/s），靠精确控制与扫描来保证准确率 [来源：Wikipedia, Cross-belt sorter, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cross-belt_sorter]。这意味着\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cross-belt_sorter]。这意味着</a> WCS 不能在包裹到达分流口时才决策——必须在扫描点就把&quot;目标格口&quot;绑定到该包裹的运输实体上，沿途各区段只转发这个绑定值。</p>\n<p><a href=\"../wcs-architecture-equipment-model/\">WCS 架构与设备模型</a> 一章会展开运输实体在系统间怎么表达；这里要记住的工程后果是：<strong>扫描点到分流口的这段线体是一段&quot;已决策、未执行&quot;的缓冲</strong>。如果在这段里格口突然满了，就没有第二次机会——包裹只能落到分流口，或者通过再循环圈（recirculation loop）绕回扫描点重新决策。</p>\n<p>交叉带分拣机的吞吐能力可以估算为&quot;线速 × 每载具格数 × 效率因子 ÷ 载具节距&quot;，多个入口同时供包时能力叠加——某资料给出的算例是三个入口各 12000 件/h，合计约 36000 件/h [来源：Wikipedia, Cross-belt sorter，同上]。这个数量级决定了格口分配策略必须能在秒级响应，否则几万件/h 的流量会把任何静态映射冲垮。</p>\n<h2 id=\"无读件-错分与再循环\">无读件、错分与再循环</h2><p>分拣线上永远有一类件拿不到 sort key：条码污损、多件重叠、面单反光。把它们当作&quot;分拣失败&quot;处理是业余做法，正确设计是给它们一个<strong>一等公民的归宿</strong>——异常格口（exception lane），并记录失败原因以便下游补救。WCS 应把手动补录、重新赋码、直接落异常口作为三条明确的策略，而不是让操作员临场发挥。</p>\n<p><strong>再循环</strong>用在&quot;这次没分掉、下次还有机会&quot;的件上：格口满了，或扫描没读到但下一圈可能读到。它提高一次分拣成功率，代价是同一件包裹占用线体容量。设计时必须设上限——一遍不行两遍，两遍不行直接落异常口，否则一个永远读不到的件会变成线上的&quot;幽灵包裹&quot;无限绕圈。</p>\n<p>另一个容易被低估的错误来源是<strong>映射下发与执行的时间差</strong>。若 WCS 在一个包裹仍在途时改了映射表，在途包裹用的却是旧映射，就会出现&quot;按新表该去 A 口、实际去了 B 口&quot;。解决办法是<strong>版本化映射</strong>：每个包裹在扫描点绑定映射版本号，执行端按该版本执行，映射表变更只对新扫描件生效。</p>\n<p>常见的错分原因与对策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失效模式</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无读件</td>\n<td>条码污损/反光</td>\n<td>多面扫描、异常口、手动补录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错分</td>\n<td>映射版本不一致</td>\n<td>版本化映射、按扫描件绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格口溢出</td>\n<td>热点目的地爆量</td>\n<td>溢出格口、动态再平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抛件</td>\n<td>线速高于载荷包络</td>\n<td>按体积/重量限速、降速段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幽灵包裹</td>\n<td>传感器误判占用</td>\n<td>区段不变式校验、定期复位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"衡量-分拣成功率-格口利用率与溢出率\">衡量：分拣成功率、格口利用率与溢出率</h2><p>格口分配策略好不好，要用可观测指标说话，而不是&quot;线跑起来了&quot;就当合格。三个核心指标：<strong>一次分拣成功率（first-pass yield）</strong>，第一次经过分流口就正确落格的占比——再循环次数上升而成功率不升，说明策略有问题而非流量太大；<strong>格口利用率分布</strong>，各格口实际处理量与容量之比，健康状态是分布紧凑，若少数格口接近 100% 而多数低于 30% 说明热点正在被牺牲；<strong>溢出率（overflow rate）</strong>，因格口满而进入再循环或异常口的占比，直接反映容量估算与预测的准确度，是跨境大促期间最先恶化的指标。</p>\n<p>容量规划可以借助利特尔法则把&quot;格口占用&quot;与&quot;清运节奏&quot;关联起来。若某格口的实际到达率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 件/h、下游清运使其平均停留时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 小时，则格口内平均积压件数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\lambda_c \\cdot W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>要控制格口不溢出，就得让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 小于格口物理容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W &lt; N_{max}/\\lambda_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这个式子把&quot;格口多大&quot;与&quot;多久清一次&quot;锁在一起，也解释了为什么跨境件在高单量期要靠加密清运班次而不是无限加空格口。</p>\n<p>设备侧的安全与合规约束会反过来限制策略的激进程度。分流机构属于机械危险区，其安全相关控制部分的性能等级需按 ISO 13849-1 评估（2023 版按 PL 与 PFHd 分档）[来源：ISO 13849-1:2023, 机械安全控制系统相关部件, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_13849]。策略上允许的&quot;高速抛件&quot;不能突破设备的安全包络。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_13849]。策略上允许的&quot;高速抛件&quot;不能突破设备的安全包络。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"落到系统-wcs-与-wms-的责任边界\">落到系统：WCS 与 WMS 的责任边界</h2><p>格口分配这件事实质上横跨两个系统，边界划错就会产生永无休止的扯皮。<strong>WMS/WES 拥有业务语义</strong>：订单、承运商、发运批次、优先级、目的地归属；它输出&quot;这件包裹属于哪个目的地&quot;。<strong>WCS 拥有物理执行</strong>：格口是它的资源，映射表、容量、占用、溢出、再循环都在它手里，它决定&quot;这个目的地此刻用哪个格口、什么时候下发指令&quot;。</p>\n<p>清晰的接口是：WMS 下发&quot;目的地 + 优先级&quot;，WCS 回报&quot;实际落格 + 失败原因&quot;。WMS 不应规定具体格口号（那是物理资源，会随线体状态变），WCS 也不应解释业务语义（那是订单的事）。这条边界与 <a href=\"../integration-throughput-ops/\">集成、吞吐与运维</a> 一章讲的 WCS-WMS 协同协议一致。把这条线画对之后，格口分配策略才能独立演进——换一次分配算法不需要动上游一行代码，这正是它值得被单独设计的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>格口是容量有限的资源，不是固定终点；目的地多于格口时映射必然一对多，靠二次分拣再拆。</li>\n<li>分拣键必须稳定可复现，按承运商/分区/收货人分三级构造；上游 WMS/WES 拥有业务语义，WCS 只执行。</li>\n<li>分配策略在稳定与均衡间取舍：静态映射省事但怕热点，溢出格口与负载再平衡对付热格口。</li>\n<li>跨境件量长尾显著，格口要按预期件量加权切分，并对头部目的地预留溢出通道。</li>\n<li>路由决策必须提前一个位置窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = v \\cdot t_{act}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，因此需要在扫描点就绑定映射版本。</li>\n<li>异常口与再循环是一等公民设计，再循环必须设次数上限以杜绝幽灵包裹。</li>\n<li>评价看一次分拣成功率、格口利用率分布与溢出率；容量由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = C \\cdot W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W &lt; N_{max}/C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 约束。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分拣格口分配与目的地路由策略","id":"分拣格口分配与目的地路由策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"目的地模型：从订单到分拣键","id":"目的地模型-从订单到分拣键"},{"level":2,"text":"格口分配策略：静态、动态与热格口","id":"格口分配策略-静态-动态与热格口"},{"level":2,"text":"路由决策的下发时机与位置窗口","id":"路由决策的下发时机与位置窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"无读件、错分与再循环","id":"无读件-错分与再循环"},{"level":2,"text":"衡量：分拣成功率、格口利用率与溢出率","id":"衡量-分拣成功率-格口利用率与溢出率"},{"level":2,"text":"落到系统：WCS 与 WMS 的责任边界","id":"落到系统-wcs-与-wms-的责任边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"输送线拓扑、积放与流量控制（ZPA）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/conveyor-sortation-routing/conveyor-topology-accumulation-flow"},"next":{"title":"错分、循环重投与格口满的异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/conveyor-sortation-routing/misroute-recirculation-exception"}}